/ Always renders disabled: laying off needs cards selected, and a fresh render
/ never has a selection (a turbo re-render resets the checkboxes). rummy-turn
/ enables it once the selection legally extends this meld. The target is only
/ present when can_lay_off — a player with no meld of their own structurally
/ cannot enable any meld, failing closed even if the JS bundle is broken.
button.meld type="button" disabled=true data-action="click->rummy-turn#layOff" data-rummy-turn-target=("meld" if can_lay_off) data-rummy-turn-meld-index-param=index
  .meld__header
    span.meld__label = meld.label
    span.meld__owner = meld.owner

  .meld__cards
    - meld.cards.each do |meld_card|
      span.meld__card class=("meld__card--red" if meld_card.card.red?) data-rank-value=meld_card.rank_value data-suit-index=meld_card.suit_index = meld_card.card.to_s
